{# Additive EOD tech internals. Render ONLY on macro.html, as a collapsed
   companion below the existing US regime surface. Numeric inputs are from
   engine.tech_volatility_shock; the screenshot is NOT a data source. #}
<div class="tvs-mount" id="tvs-mount">
<style>
.tvs-mount{grid-column:1/-1;width:min(100%,1120px);margin:20px auto 28px;font-family:var(--font-ui)}
.tvs-mount *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tvs{color:var(--text);background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-card,12px);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--card-shadow)}
.tvs summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:17px 20px}
.tvs summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tvs summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--info);outline-offset:-3px}
.tvs-kicker{font-size:10px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.17em;color:var(--link);text-transform:uppercase}
.tvs-brief{display:block;font-weight:760;font-size:17px;margin-top:3px}
.tvs-summary-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end}
.tvs-rel{font-size:20px;font-weight:780;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tvs-neg{color:var(--down)}.tvs-pos{color:var(--up)}.tvs-muted{color:var(--muted)}
.tvs-toggle{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.tvs[open] .tvs-toggle::after{content:" Close \25B2"}
.tvs:not([open]) .tvs-toggle::after{content:" Details \25BC"}
.tvs-body{padding:0 20px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.tvs-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:730;color:var(--muted)}
.tvs-ruler{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin:16px 0}
.tvs-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.tvs-card{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--down);border-radius:var(--r-card,12px);padding:16px}
.tvs-card-head{font-size:22px;font-weight:800}
.tvs-amount{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,52px);line-height:1.3;font-weight:830;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tvs-table{margin-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.tvs-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-quiet)}
.tvs-line span:first-child{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}
.tvs-line strong{font-size:13px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tvs-rank{margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:780}
.tvs-relative{margin-top:16px;text-align:center;padding:16px;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--info);border-radius:var(--r-card,12px)}
.tvs-relative .tvs-amount{font-size:36px}
.tvs-section-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:790;margin:24px 0 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:10px}
.tvs-session{margin:14px 0}
.tvs-session-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;font-weight:760;margin-bottom:7px}
.tvs-bars{display:flex;height:40px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--panel2);border-radius:var(--r-ctl,8px)}
.tvs-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:0;font-size:11px;font-weight:750;white-space:nowrap}
.tvs-bar span{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;padding:0 8px}
.tvs-overnight{background:var(--down)}.tvs-intraday{background:var(--q3)}
.tvs-mixed{padding:11px 13px;background:var(--panel2);border-radius:var(--r-ctl,8px);font-size:12px;color:var(--text)}
.tvs-bottom{margin-top:22px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px;font-weight:810;text-align:center}
.tvs-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;margin:10px 0 0}
.tvs-notice{margin:16px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-ctl,8px);color:var(--text);font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:640px){.tvs-mount{margin:14px 0}.tvs summary{padding:14px;align-items:flex-start}.tvs-summary-meta{gap:4px;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end}.tvs-rel{font-size:17px}.tvs-brief{font-size:15px}.tvs-body{padding:0 12px 16px}.tvs-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.tvs-amount{font-size:38px}.tvs-bar{font-size:10px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.tvs *, .tvs *::before, .tvs *::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
html[data-lang="zh"] .tvs[open] .tvs-toggle::after{content:" 收起 \25B2"}
html[data-lang="zh"] .tvs:not([open]) .tvs-toggle::after{content:" 详情 \25BC"}
</style>
<details class="tvs" id="tech-volatility-shock">
  <summary>
    <span><span class="tvs-kicker l-en">Quantitative Research / Market Internals</span><span class="tvs-kicker l-zh">定量研究 / 市场内部结构</span>
      <span class="tvs-brief"><span class="l-en">Tech volatility shock</span><span class="l-zh">科技股波动冲击</span> <span class="tvs-muted" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500"><span class="l-en">· EOD</span><span class="l-zh">· 收盘数据</span></span></span></span>
    <span class="tvs-summary-meta">
      {% if tech_shock.relative_pp is not none %}
        <strong class="tvs-rel {{ 'tvs-neg' if tech_shock.relative_pp < 0 else 'tvs-pos' if tech_shock.relative_pp > 0 else 'tvs-muted' }}"><span class="l-en">QQQ vs SPY</span><span class="l-zh">QQQ 相对 SPY</span> {{ '%+.2f'|format(tech_shock.relative_pp) }} <span class="l-en">pp</span><span class="l-zh">百分点</span></strong>
      {% else %}
        <span class="tvs-muted" style="font-size:12px"><span class="l-en">Data unavailable</span><span class="l-zh">数据不可用</span></span>
      {% endif %}
      <span class="tvs-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </span>
  </summary>
  <div class="tvs-body">
    <div class="tvs-ruler"><span class="tvs-label"><span class="l-en">SPY / QQQ · Same-session comparison</span><span class="l-zh">SPY / QQQ · 同一交易日对比</span></span>
      <span class="tvs-muted" style="font-size:12px"><span class="l-en">As of</span><span class="l-zh">截至</span> {{ tech_shock.asof or 'unknown' }}{% if tech_shock.source_state == 'published_projection' %} <span class="l-en">· Last qualified published observation</span><span class="l-zh">· 最近合格发布值</span>{% endif %}</span></div>
    {% if tech_shock.status != 'ok' %}
      <div class="tvs-notice" role="status">
        <span class="l-en">{{ 'Stale observation' if tech_shock.status == 'stale' else 'Partial observation' if tech_shock.status == 'partial' else 'Unverified source coverage' }}:</span><span class="l-zh">{{ '数据已延迟：' if tech_shock.status == 'stale' else '部分数据缺失：' if tech_shock.status == 'partial' else '来源数据不可用：' }}</span>
        <span class="l-en">{{ tech_shock.reason or 'Some observations are unavailable.' }}</span><span class="l-zh">请检查原始数据可用性和截止时间。</span>
        {% if tech_shock.lag_sessions is not none and tech_shock.lag_sessions > 0 %} {{ tech_shock.lag_sessions }} <span class="l-en">completed exchange session(s) behind.</span><span class="l-zh">个已完成交易日未更新。</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if tech_shock.indices %}
      <div class="tvs-grid">
        {% for row in tech_shock.indices %}
          <div class="tvs-card">
            <div class="tvs-card-head">{{ row.symbol }}</div>
            <div class="tvs-amount {{ 'tvs-neg' if row.return_pct < 0 else 'tvs-pos' if row.return_pct > 0 else 'tvs-muted' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(row.return_pct) }}%</div>
            <div class="tvs-table">
              <div class="tvs-line"><span><span class="l-en">Prior 60-session return z</span><span class="l-zh">此前60日收益 Z 值</span></span><strong>{% if row.z60 is not none %}{{ '%+.2f'|format(row.z60) }}{% else %}<span class="l-en">Unavailable</span><span class="l-zh">不可用</span>{% endif %}</strong></div>
              <div class="tvs-line"><span><span class="l-en">Full-day volume / 20d mean</span><span class="l-zh">全日成交量 / 前20日均值</span></span><strong>{% if row.volume_multiple is not none %}{{ '%.2f×'|format(row.volume_multiple) }}{% else %}<span class="l-en">Unavailable</span><span class="l-zh">不可用</span>{% endif %}</strong></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tvs-rank">
              {% if row.rank_ytd is not none %}<span class="l-en">#{{ row.rank_ytd }} worst observed day of {{ row.year }} ({{ row.n_ytd }} eligible sessions)</span><span class="l-zh">{{ row.year }}年观测跌幅倒数第{{ row.rank_ytd }}名（{{ row.n_ytd }}个有效交易日）</span>
              {% else %}<span class="l-en">Year-to-date rank unavailable</span><span class="l-zh">年内排名不可用</span>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="tvs-relative">
        <div class="tvs-label" style="color:var(--info)"><span class="l-en">QQQ relative to SPY</span><span class="l-zh">QQQ 相对 SPY</span></div>
        <div class="tvs-amount {{ 'tvs-neg' if tech_shock.relative_pp < 0 else 'tvs-pos' if tech_shock.relative_pp > 0 else 'tvs-muted' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(tech_shock.relative_pp) }} <span class="l-en">pp</span><span class="l-zh">百分点</span></div>
        <div class="tvs-muted" style="font-size:13px"><span class="l-en">Prior 60-session relative z:</span><span class="l-zh">此前60日相对收益 Z 值：</span> <strong>{% if tech_shock.relative_z60 is not none %}{{ '%+.2f'|format(tech_shock.relative_z60) }}{% else %}<span class="l-en">Unavailable</span><span class="l-zh">不可用</span>{% endif %}</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tvs-section-title"><span class="l-en">When the selling hit</span><span class="l-zh">抛售发生在何时</span> <span class="tvs-muted" style="float:right;font-size:11px;font-weight:500"><span class="l-en">Overnight vs regular session</span><span class="l-zh">隔夜与常规时段</span></span></div>
      {% for row in tech_shock.indices %}
        <div class="tvs-session">
          <div class="tvs-session-head"><span>{{ row.symbol }}</span><span class="tvs-muted" style="font-size:11px"><span class="l-en">Overnight {{ '%+.2f'|format(row.overnight_pct) }}% · Intraday {{ '%+.2f'|format(row.intraday_pct) }}%</span><span class="l-zh">隔夜 {{ '%+.2f'|format(row.overnight_pct) }}% · 日间 {{ '%+.2f'|format(row.intraday_pct) }}%</span></span></div>
          {% if row.overnight_share is not none %}
            <div class="tvs-bars" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tvs-bar tvs-overnight" style="width:{{ row.overnight_share }}%"><span><span class="l-en">Overnight</span><span class="l-zh">隔夜</span></span></div>
              <div class="tvs-bar tvs-intraday" style="width:{{ 100 - row.overnight_share }}%"><span><span class="l-en">Intraday</span><span class="l-zh">日间</span></span></div>
            </div>
          {% else %}
            <div class="tvs-mixed"><span class="l-en">Mixed or positive leg: a loss-contribution bar would be misleading.</span><span class="l-zh">有正收益或方向混合的时段，不适合使用跌幅贡献条。</span></div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="tvs-bottom">
        {% if tech_shock.session_read == 'overnight_dominant' %}<span class="l-en">Most of both ETFs' negative session legs occurred before the open.</span><span class="l-zh">两只 ETF 的负收益主要发生在常规开盘前。</span>
        {% elif tech_shock.session_read == 'intraday_dominant' %}<span class="l-en">Both ETFs' negative session legs were intraday-dominant.</span><span class="l-zh">两只 ETF 的负收益主要发生在常规交易时段。</span>
        {% else %}<span class="l-en">The two ETFs show mixed overnight and intraday pressure.</span><span class="l-zh">两只 ETF 的隔夜与日间压力表现不一致。</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="tvs-mixed"><span class="l-en">The shock comparison is unavailable until two complete, paired SPY/QQQ raw daily OHLC histories are present.</span><span class="l-zh">SPY 与 QQQ 的原始日线开高低收数据齐备且日期一致后，才会显示冲击对比。</span></div>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="tvs-note l-en">Source: existing Massive/Polygon unadjusted daily aggregates. Price O/H/L/C = regular NYSE trading session; reported volume = broader full market day. Overnight = prior regular close to current regular open (includes premarket); intraday = regular open to close. They compound, so rounded legs need not sum exactly to close-to-close performance. Z-scores compare today's return with the previous 60 sessions, excluding today; volume baseline excludes today. Historical ranks are observed sample ranks, not event probabilities. EOD context only, not a predictive trade alert.</p>
    <p class="tvs-note l-zh">来源：现有 Massive/Polygon 未复权日聚合数据。开高低收取纽交所常规交易时段；报告的成交量涵盖更广的全日交易活动。隔夜收益从前一常规收盘到当前常规开盘（含盘前）；日间收益从开盘到收盘。两段收益按复利相乘，因此四舍五入后不一定直接相加等于收盘对收盘收益。Z 值使用此前60个交易日收益（不包含当日）；成交量均值也不包含当日。年内排名仅为样本中的观察排名，不代表事件发生概率。本面板仅供收盘后市场背景分析，不构成预测或交易信号。</p>
  </div>
</details>
</div>
<script>
(function () {
  'use strict';
  // Existing #regime-radar owns the Macro decision surface. Move this compact
  // drill-down immediately AFTER it, never above it or onto the stocks route.
  var item = document.getElementById('tvs-mount');
  var anchor = document.getElementById('regime-radar');
  if (!item || !anchor || !anchor.parentNode) return;
  var section = anchor.closest('section') || anchor;
  if (section !== item && section.parentNode) section.insertAdjacentElement('afterend', item);
})();
</script>
